on.vim (7a944f2 =\u0026gt; 80db3bf)","ts":"1634220193.369900","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"Update success: Shougo/ddc.vim (bd471e4 =\u0026gt; 9c43cf1)","ts":"1634220193.369800","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"Update success: Shougo/dein.vim (58b73f2 =\u0026gt; 43fec0c)","ts":"1634220192.369700","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"3961f8fb-2cd5-4c53-9bc6-be4cf5131d65","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":":vimhelp plugin update","ts":"1634220191.369600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"31kA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"79a5bae5-92f9-42cd-85ac-6a1b65b8475c","type":"message","user":"U01E2DL1U22","text":"`expand('%')` カレントバッファのパスを得るのには便利なんだが","ts":"1634177214.369200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0u0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"23ba6e62-4ff4-423c-94f7-98b3533582a9","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"どのみちバグだと思うので本家に報告するとよさそう","ts":"1634176634.368000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OTD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d769c779-9074-46d0-880c-1fdea0e7ef2f","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"skkeletonは確か今のところdeno側でチルダを置換してたはず","ts":"1634175495.367400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SZP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"92500ca4-a17f-425b-b7c1-f570449f4f2c","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"チルダの展開したいだけならやめた方がよい","ts":"1634175465.366900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"E6M"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0d34cf0f-6e69-41b0-8468-047507a6f102","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"skkeletonの辞書指定の時にもそんな話ありましたね\nチルダを展開するためだけにexpandを使うべきか否か","ts":"1634175439.366300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UM2z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1e38b9bc-6a0f-4143-866d-419cbae15b91","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"私は独自のラッパーをよく使うかな","ts":"1634175404.365700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Xr3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"220da40c-8120-4b59-9b2f-6c55f6e0c660","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"expandは複雑なので、副作用が大きいですよ","ts":"1634175395.365300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"u=9v"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d51bd079-328d-4e78-8a76-c0dea26408d9","type":"message","user":"U01E2DL1U22","text":"少し気にして補完に使う関数のパス展開には特に必要がない限りは `fnamemodify()` の方を使うことにします。`expand()` はタイプしやすく引数の数が少なかったのでものぐさコーディングに便利でしたが実は要らない機能が付きすぎていました。","ts":"1634172381.364300","edited":{"user":"U01E2DL1U22","ts":"1634172887.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XmjB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"60db0adf-ea46-4d1f-b44a-55690984ab72","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"細かい挙動など見過ごされますからね、補完にとって元の候補に戻れる機能はそこまで重要でもないですし","ts":"1634171876.361500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=PG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"96c35ef5-1900-46f4-9e94-894c9b4c90ae","type":"message","user":"U01E2DL1U22","text":"```  let path = fnamemodify('~/.vimrc', ':p')```\nに変えると再現しないから `expand()` 犯人説が濃くなりました。","ts":"1634171755.360300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"m6s"}]},{"client_msg_id":"adc0f779-0db1-4d60-9398-74b7819edcda","type":"message","user":"U01E2DL1U22","text":"え、本当ですね。`expand()` だけで再現しますね。今までなぜ気づかれなかったのか。コマンドライン補完を真剣に使おうとする人があまりいなかったのか。","ts":"1634170678.358800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Q5kl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"40a2f0fe-6669-4179-8af8-ff94c25189c0","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"```変数の個数とリストの要素数が一致しないときはエラーになる。リストにある余分な要\n素をまとめて受け取るには、\";\" と受け取る変数名を書いておく: \u0026gt;\n\t:let [var1, var2; rest] = mylist```\nこんなのあったのか","ts":"1634170371.356900","thread_ts":"1634170371.356900","reply_count":2,"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wB8b"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1ae339b9-79ac-439f-b0e9-0a87f059fef7","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"HEADでも再現するので多分バグですね","ts":"1634169015.356100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4sr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"041cd694-929a-4d6a-b62c-6f47cb758ca2","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"expandが原因っぽい","ts":"1634168940.355500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LH="}]},{"client_msg_id":"7e75aba5-c7b8-4227-935f-f788cf315b66","type":"message","user":"U01E2DL1U22","text":"コマンドライン補完を呼び出すときに、途中で `readfile()` すると結果が違うのですけどこれは最新版でも再現するでしょうか？\n```function! s:sample1(arglead, cmdline, csrpos) abort\n  return ['foo', 'bar', 'baz']\nendfunc\ncommand! -nargs=* -complete=customlist,s:sample1 Sample1   :echo 'sample1'\n\nfunction! s:sample2(arglead, cmdline, csrpos) abort\n  let path = expand('~/.vimrc')\n  if filereadable(path)\n    call readfile(path)\n  endif\n  return ['foo', 'bar', 'baz']\nendfunc\ncommand! -nargs=* -complete=customlist,s:sample2 Sample2   :echo 'sample2'```\nSample1 では、補完は 「foo → bar → baz → 補完前の入力」を循環しますが、Sample2 では、補完前の入力に循環しません。","ts":"1634168175.355200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Gs0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f61ecc27-d9a3-4302-8335-c4bfbfef073f","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":"js の分割代入みたい...","ts":"1634170446.357000","thread_ts":"1634170371.356900","parent_user_id":"UAZ33BKV2","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"A31"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e184506c-84e5-4da1-8d2d-39a90b612151","type":"message","user":"U01E2DL1U22","text":"可変長リストの可変部分に使ったりします。","ts":"1634170856.358900","thread_ts":"1634170371.356900","parent_user_id":"UAZ33BKV2","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CUj"}]}]
